	<section_number>1-225</section_number>
	<catch_line>Nonlegislative citizen member</catch_line>
	<text>
		"Nonlegislative citizen member" means any natural person who is not a member of the General Assembly of Virginia.
	</text>
	<history>2004, c. 709, § 1-13.13:1; 2005, c. 839.</history>
</law>
